		'option_d' => 'Post the concern in the shared organizational chat so the widest team can respond.',
		'correct_option' => 'a',
		'explanation' => "A. Correct. A safety exception does not convert the entire record into unrestricted information; disclosure should remain tied to the authorized purpose.\n\nB. Incorrect. An exception is not a blanket authorization for unrelated information.\n\nC. Incorrect. Some protective disclosures are authorized or required without client authorization.\n\nD. Incorrect. Wider distribution is not automatically necessary or authorized.\n\nCTA Exam Strategy: Identify the legal threshold, who has the duty, the required timing or protective step, and the narrow scope of any disclosure.",
