	array(
		'question_text' => 'In litigation, counsel argues that every therapy communication is privileged and can never be disclosed, while another party argues that filing a lawsuit automatically waives all psychotherapy privilege. Which analysis is BEST?',
		'option_a' => 'The therapist should decide based only on which party appears more credible.',
