		'correct_option' => 'b',
		'explanation' => "A. Incorrect. Training cannot convert an expressly excluded activity into LPCC scope.\n\nB. Correct. California's LPCC assessment definition includes many assessment activities but expressly excludes individually administered intelligence tests and other specified methods.\n\nC. Incorrect. The statute expressly excludes certain testing activities from LPCC assessment.\n\nD. Incorrect. Consent cannot expand statutory scope.\n\nCTA Exam Strategy: Separate professional status, lawful setting/scope, representation, documentation, and conduct requirements; consent cannot expand legal authority.",
