		'correct_option' => 'c',
		'explanation' => "A. Incorrect. Client initiation does not eliminate the professional prohibition and power imbalance.\n\nB. Incorrect. A brief pause does not transform a current therapeutic relationship into an ethically and legally acceptable sexual relationship.\n\nC. Correct. California professional-conduct law prohibits sexual misconduct with current patients/clients; consent and location do not cure the prohibition.\n\nD. Incorrect. A waiver cannot legalize prohibited professional conduct.\n\nCTA Exam Strategy: Separate professional status, lawful setting/scope, representation, documentation, and conduct requirements; consent cannot expand legal authority.",
